name: Source-class preparation respects allowance and never completes a Scan
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/pipeline_selection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP | fresh-setup
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: run pipeline:taint-cwe-select {"cwes":["CWE-20"]}
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 selected 1 CWE class | supplied-selection
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/pipeline_selection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART supplied
submit: run pipeline:taint-cwe-select
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/pipeline_selection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
ask: Do supplied classes complete without model work, while model selection refuses unapproved work without creating Scan completion?
paste-file: @ART/approve-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance-review
expect: Total provider calls: 2
expect: Protected review calls: 1
resize: 160x48
live-snap: allowance-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: allowance-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: allowance-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: allowance-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: allowance-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-controls-40x12
ask: Are the finite proposal allowance, protected Review call, selected model, unknown dollars and no-scan boundary readable by paging at all six sizes?
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | allowance-approved
paste-file: @ART/select-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 35 Owned source marker | proposed-selection
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/pipeline_selection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 1/2 | retained-accounting
expect: protected review remaining: 1
paste-file: @ART/select-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted | next-request-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/pipeline_selection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Map | no-scan-completion
ask: Does one class proposal retain its request cost without findings, new Scan jobs or primary completion, and does a second request preserve protected Review capacity?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 1/2 | recovered-accounting
expect: protected review remaining: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/pipeline_selection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
